2. `sdd/wip/20260921-blackstore-pilot/` — piloto companion (puertos/fixtures hasta GO).
3. `sdd/wip/20260921-blackstore-pos-core/` — **superseded** (`SUPERSEDED.md`). ISSUE/REVERSAL no ejecutable.
